### 1. Create a post
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "My first TounsiGuide recommendation",
  "locationId": null
}

### 2. List all posts
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts

### 3. Get one post
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts/1

### 4. Update the post
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "My updated TounsiGuide recommendation",
  "locationId": null
}

### 5. Get the updated post
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts/1

### 6. Delete the post
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts/1

### 7. Confirm deletion
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/posts/1
